{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "7de6b25a22c30493fc1409557def074d8bbecc158296b4bbb0dcebfb6102c590", "ja": "プールは鉄板！　アイドルの見せ場だよ！", "zh": "泳池可是定番！这正是偶像大显身手的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1e1fff255389a440f1f5aa24e58c35aabc70c63f9f0acfac4c96fb427e311cf5", "ja": "『アイドル水着大運動会』当日、会場の\n巨大プールにはしゃぐアイドルたち。\nエキシビションマッチとはいえ今後のバトル\nのためにもここで爪痕を残そうと、気合いを\n入れる茜の姿に紬と可奈も気を引き締める。", "zh": "在『偶像泳装大运动会』当天，偶像们在会场的\n巨大泳池中兴奋不已。虽说只是表演赛，但为了\n今后的战斗，茜也打起精神，想要在这里留下\n自己的印记。看到这样的茜，紬和可奈也跟着\n认真起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "7e33987284d47e2f8b0e9f6271dc6da357801220fb08268ebca2583c1262ff28", "ja": "いえーい！　茜ちゃん一番乗り～っ！\nつむりんは惜しくも二番！", "zh": "耶——！我是小茜第一名赶到的～！\n小紬很遗憾排在第二！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9b950cefc2413f1a8ce63768b0fa43cbd9aca028ca47b324f468cddfd2f24f2f", "ja": "えっ、いつのまに競争に……！？", "zh": "诶，什么时候变成比赛了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b7e298bf993466a44960b5e066ae6afce708696b1b9cade8c0aa302449b687cf", "ja": "おーい、二人とも。はしゃぐのはいいけど、\n危ないからプールサイドは走るなよー。", "zh": "喂，你们两个。兴奋归兴奋，\n但很危险，别在泳池边跑啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fccfd0811eb9f99a24a812f489c97e92218d03036387ac8ead8c47e73903a5bb", "ja": "は、走ってません！\nそれにまだ、はしゃいでもいません！", "zh": "没、没有在跑！\n而且还没有兴奋起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "f6171b56344a8af96c1361f116416aa511646c9d75ddbaffd113c65d61023c80", "ja": "わぁ～すっごく広いですね～！\nみんなでプール～♪　る～るるる～♪", "zh": "哇～这里真宽敞啊～！\n大家一起去游泳池～♪　啦～啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "47e64ec31e885806c794c17cb81a8571f43d21e78cabe108a363295bf6600700", "ja": "えへへっ♪　今日はバトルじゃないから、\nみんなで楽しくプールで遊べばいいんですよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪今天不是对战，所以大家一起在泳池开心地玩就可以了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e41582a49400825e4d65a2bd85994f51e7d9984c6ca059d4da44b054cdb66b36", "ja": "そうだな、エキシビションマッチだから、\n確かにチームの勝敗はつけないけど……。", "zh": "没错，毕竟是表演赛，确实不会判定队伍的胜负……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c729cea2c358d7e388aead04a29f26b45b8778febaf8357c1a00d02336790ffc", "ja": "……けど？\nもしかして、また何かよからぬ企みがあるのですか？", "zh": "……但是？\n难道说，您又在打什么坏主意了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a5afe632548a1be154c6c7f074497cdaa0ed25f732d9cf98413b2b5473cf5e50", "ja": "いや、あくまで今日のプールも、\n『BATTLE OF THEATER』の一環だからな。", "zh": "不，说到底今天的游泳池活动，\n也是“BATTLE OF THEATER”的一环嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "e7445b14fc8e1c4a7f1b2d1b65f8c8cc66a0854198e48447db4795cc468b004c", "ja": "そうそう！　みんなで楽しく遊ぶだけなんて、\nつむりんも可奈ちゃんも甘い！　甘すぎるよ！", "zh": "对对！要是以为只是和大家开心地玩玩，紬和可奈也太天真了！简直天真过头啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "97caa1089e64b9ca4f4fafa383df271806620473d5d99eb059bd74c6155501c9", "ja": "ここでファンを増やせば、この後のバトルだって有利！\nバッチリ爪痕を残さないとネ♪", "zh": "在这里增加粉丝的话，接下来的战斗也会更有利！\n一定要留下深刻印象才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a96e92ffc29a34f2c98553e069a24e6b39da74d476dfe3fb9e7048ccf0b769ca", "ja": "はっ！　そうですね。私もチームの一員として、\n足を引っ張らないようにしなくては……！", "zh": "啊！说得对。我也作为团队的一员，必须不能拖后腿……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e8c5c8f93bc7113689eaedc474d4d1d6c0339b666fecc8eb6590293b5c9fb1d3", "ja": "気負いすぎる必要はないけど、アイドルとして\nお客さんと一緒に楽しむ姿勢は、常に忘れずにな！", "zh": "不用给自己太大压力，但作为偶像，要始终记住和客人一起享受其中的态度哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_01_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "6a4f613079f819b0f44b0322e61f6a3d65e09ec6108b80c796a5db6cb27df247", "ja": "はーいっ！　みんなでプールを思いっきり楽しんで、\n爪痕もグイグイ残しますっ！　頑張るぞ～♪", "zh": "好——！大家一起尽情享受泳池的乐趣，还要留下深刻的印象！加油——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
